design\releases\0_0_3\F_73_drag_card_to_first_place_fails.md:21:`CardView` resolves a drop before the first card as target index `0` and calls `CardOperations.moveCard`. `computeMove` already intends to clear the moved card's `after`, point the previous first card to the moved card, and repair the moved card's old follower. Unit coverage verifies the computed updates, but no persistence-level regression test verifies the saved chain. In practice, first-position moves fail within the same column and across columns, causing the card to return to its old position or the end.
